description: Testing requirements
alwaysApply: false
globs: "**/*.{ts,tsx}"
Testing Rules

New business functionality should have tests.

Prioritize tests for:

authentication
authorization
payments
orders
inventory
accounting
refunds
reseller commissions

Payment tests must consider:

success
failure
pending
timeout
duplicate webhook
replayed webhook
invalid callback
refund

Order tests must consider:

creation
cancellation
shipping
delivery
return
refund

Inventory tests must consider:

sale
return
reservation
adjustment

Accounting tests must verify:

Debit total = Credit total

Never delete tests simply to make code pass.

Run the smallest relevant test suite during development.

Run broader tests before completing a milestone.